  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be the solution curve of the differential equation<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math><br />, which passes through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mfenced><msqrt><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to _______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given differential equation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now integrating both side,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
